# Tech-chase reaction: knock the dummy down; it techs in place, rolls in, rolls away or misses. Hit it after the tech.
name: Tech chase
about: Knock the dummy down, read its tech and hit it within 30 frames of the landing.
start: here
cpu: none
react: di in strength 60
adapt: tech
options: in_place roll_in roll_away miss
weights: 4 4 4 4
react: getup stand delay 10
trigger: dummy_tech
success: hit 30
par: 12
timeout: 600
loop: after 45
